      "versionNonce": 423,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1761264000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Arrow = “depends on”. The map shows the main runtime spine; exact dependsOn lists (including identity → accounting/catalog/invoicing/platform, reports → invoicing and POS → parties) are in 02-api.md. identity\nis the shared auth kernel: every domain may import JwtAuthGuard / @CurrentUser.",
      "fontSize": 12.5,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Arrow = “depends on”. The map shows the main runtime spine; exact dependsOn lists (including identity → accounting/catalog/invoicing/platform, reports → invoicing and POS → parties) are in 02-api.md. identity\nis the shared auth kernel: every domain may import JwtAuthGuard / @CurrentUser.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": false
    },
